  (text "USB-C sink: 5.1k pull-downs on CC1 and CC2 tell a USB-C charger or\nC-to-C cable to turn on 5 V (each CC pin needs its own resistor).\nD+/D-/SBU are not used. USB-A-to-C cables supply 5 V regardless." (at 25.4 116.84 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3a8e5e8a-6a69-5dbb-9924-93be943a6bf1)
  )
  (text "M3 mounting hole\n(logo end, no connection)" (at 241.3 83.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e54429eb-92a8-5066-ae8f-7302e6b6923a)
  )
  (text "8 LEDs, each with its own resistor (parallel branches).\nI(LED) ≈ (5.0 V - 2.9 V) / 100 Ω ≈ 21 mA  (typical LED-strip drive current)\nTotal ≈ 168 mA from USB. P(R) ≈ 44 mW (0805 rating 125 mW).\nD1-D8: XINGLIGHT XL-2835WWC-02 warm white 2835 (2800-3000 K), LCSC C2843875\nR1-R8: UNI-ROYAL 0805W8F1000T5E 100R 1% 0805, LCSC C17408" (at 81.28 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f78d3841-b4fa-5989-abe5-6c77fde17c42)
  )
